#: 0f6b2148f01d4828ad3b57975128a8d4
msgid ""
"Whole-body MPC — **全身控制** (`ocs2_wbc_controller`) — for wheeled dual-arm "
"robots, using `ocs2_wheel_humanoid`."
msgstr "全身 MPC — **全身控制**（`ocs2_wbc_controller`）— 面向轮式双臂，使用 `ocs2_wheel_humanoid`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:11
#: 4b20573b389145d1adb66bd16ed7f77b
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:13
#: 9e8c2958af2d4e729e2f0eb0ec77c1e5
msgid ""
"Unified **全身控制** stack: one `ocs2_wbc_controller` instead of arm MPC plus"
" separate body/head joint controllers"
msgstr "统一的**全身控制**栈：一个 `ocs2_wbc_controller`，而不是手臂 MPC 加独立的身体/头关节控制器"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:14
#: 17df4b53cbce4db9ba5df40f72e2a145
msgid ""
"Motion library: `ocs2_wheel_humanoid` (see "
"[ocs2-humanoid](4-ocs2_humanoid.md))"
msgstr "[ocs2-humanoid](4-ocs2_humanoid.md)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:16
#: 27fff5016d304f25b91b84d0b34cea87
msgid ""
"Contrast with **分体控制**: [OCS2 Arm Controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) +"
" [Basic Joint Controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md) via "
"`split_body.launch.py`."
msgstr ""
"对照 **分体控制**：[OCS2 Arm Controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) + [Basic "
"Joint Controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md)，通过 `split_body.launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:18
#: 8e7693545ab4493f89c672cbb6995420
msgid "Launch (from `ocs2_arm_controller`)"
msgstr "启动（来自 `ocs2_arm_controller`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:20
#: 4c2951d352614d9aafd81c1740827243
msgid ""
"There is no public README listing a `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` "
"entry point. The in-tree path that loads this controller is:"
msgstr "公开 README 没有列出 `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` 入口。仓库内加载该控制器的路径是："

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:22
#: e9457cb39dd2461ca13dcb16687a9d73
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=<robot>"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=<robot>"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:26
#: c63e3725ea714a0e9cbba8263971ac88
msgid ""
"`full_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` `full_body`) spawns "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` when the robot’s `controller_manager` type is "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`."
msgstr ""
"当机器人 `controller_manager` 的 type 为 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` "
"时，`full_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` 为 `full_body`）会拉起 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:28
#: 3129f3f1c6e84f5799028ba6bbd8c134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The same file declares `type` and "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` (`left_type` / `right_type`, "
"`use_profile_eef`). End-effectors: [OCS2 Arm "
"Controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) and "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md). Planning URDF is the "
"same xacro path (`planning_urdf_path`); static "
"`urdf/{robot}_{robot_type}.urdf` lookup was removed."
msgstr ""
"同一文件还声明 `type` 和 `create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`（`left_type` / "
"`right_type`、`use_profile_eef`）。末端：[OCS2 Arm "
"Controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) 与 "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)。规划 URDF 同样走 xacro "
"（`planning_urdf_path`）；静态 `urdf/{robot}_{robot_type}.urdf` 查找已移除。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:30
#: 427436e00f724c8bb14daa9f3c48b934
msgid ""
"`split_body.launch.py` is the split (分体) path; whole-body control uses "
"`full_body.launch.py`."
msgstr "`split_body.launch.py` 是分体路径；全身控制用 `full_body.launch.py`。"

