#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:5
#: a2540d3745b8480ea827a35b78182467
msgid "Run the deb, clone the source to edit it"
msgstr "用 deb 运行，要改代码再克隆源码"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:8
#: f02af7f427154064a18e4c7cd2cfb3c6
msgid ""
"You can run `ocs2_wbc_controller` without opening the private repository."
" It ships in the GitHub Release package `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control`, "
"together with `ocs2_humanoid` and `lina_planning` ([arms deb "
"notes](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/README.deb.md)). In `open-deploy-ws` or "
"`fa-deploy-ws`, choose `d` for arms in `./init_repo.sh`, or run "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`. That script installs the "
"standard package. It does not install `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control-full`,"
" and the package is not on Ubuntu or ROS apt."
msgstr ""
"运行 `ocs2_wbc_controller` 不必打开私有仓库。它在 GitHub Release 包 `ros-jazzy-arms-"
"ros2-control` 里，一起的还有 `ocs2_humanoid` 和 `lina_planning`（[arms 的 deb "
"说明](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/README.deb.md)）。在 `open-deploy-ws` 或 `fa-"
"deploy-ws` 里，`./init_repo.sh` 给 arms 选 `d`，或运行 "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`。脚本装的是标准包，不会装 `ros-jazzy-"
"arms-ros2-control-full`，也不在 Ubuntu 或 ROS 的 apt 源里。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:10
#: 6800a55a98c1472e89eecf3b313d98d1
msgid ""
"[ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-"
"controller) is the source checkout under `controller/ocs2_wbc_controller`"
" in [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control). Open it when you need to read or change the "
"source. Topics and FSM values that are only written in that README stay "
"there. The public loader is `full_body.launch.py`."
msgstr ""
"[ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-"
"controller) 是 [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control) 里 `controller/ocs2_wbc_controller` "
"的源码检出。要读源码或改源码时再打开它。只写在那份 README 里的话题和 FSM 取值，仍以那份 README 为准。公开侧的加载入口是 "
"`full_body.launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:45
#: 67fbbd8585614478a1f6471918bd919c
msgid ""
"These topics need `ocs2_wbc_controller` and that robot’s 全身 launch and "
"config. `demo.launch.py` and 分体 (`split_body.launch.py`) do not start "
"them. Capability bits (`WbcCapability`) depend on the robot. Public Taku "
"mock uses `split_body.launch.py robot:=taku` (arm MPC, body and head "
"basic controllers, and grippers). `full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` needs"
" `ocs2_wbc_controller` from the `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` deb, or "
"from a source checkout. Shipping `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` is not"
" enough. With that config and the controller installed, Taku full-body "
"default `headMode` is `HEAD_GAZE` (gaze on "
"`head_camera_mid_optical_frame`), and `target_manager.yaml` has "
"`enable_head_control: false`. Head 6D tracking (`HEAD_TRACKING`) is there"
" when `head_tracking_ee_enabled` is true. Taku’s body-relative rest is "
"around x≈−0.21, not Bot2 `[0, 0.25]`. Full tables: [FSM and "
"Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
msgstr ""
"这些话题需要 `ocs2_wbc_controller`，以及这台机器人的全身 launch 和配置。`demo.launch.py` "
"和分体（`split_body.launch.py`）不会启动它们。能力位（`WbcCapability`）取决于这台机器人。公开的 Taku "
"mock 用 `split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`（手臂 "
"MPC、身体和头部的基础控制器，以及夹爪）。`full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` 需要 `ros-jazzy-"
"arms-ros2-control` 这个 deb 里的 `ocs2_wbc_controller`，或一份源码检出。只带 "
"`config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` 不够。配置和控制器都装上之后，Taku 全身模式默认 `headMode` 是"
" `HEAD_GAZE`（注视 `head_camera_mid_optical_frame`），`target_manager.yaml` 里 "
"`enable_head_control: false`。`head_tracking_ee_enabled` 为真时才有头部 6D "
"跟踪（`HEAD_TRACKING`）。Taku 相对身体的静止位置大约在 x≈−0.21，不是 Bot2 的 `[0, 0.25]`。完整表见 "
"[FSM 与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。"

